{"id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#thm:chow-iii-closed-evolving-heat-kernel","title":"thm:chow-iii-closed-evolving-heat-kernel","path":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics.md","line":19,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics.tex#thm:chow-iii-closed-evolving-heat-kernel","uses":["[[references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#def:chow-iii-evolving-heat-kernel]]","[[references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#prop:chow-iii-evolving-parametrix]]","[[references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#lem:chow-iii-parametrix-convolution-derivatives]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics.tex","label":"thm:chow-iii-closed-evolving-heat-kernel","line":44,"source":"\\begin{theorem}[Existence of the heat kernel on closed \\(\\mathcal M^n\\)]\n\\label{thm:chow-iii-closed-evolving-heat-kernel}\n\\source{chow-et-al-ricci-flow-part-iii:page-0288}\n\\uses{def:chow-iii-evolving-heat-kernel, prop:chow-iii-evolving-parametrix, lem:chow-iii-parametrix-convolution-derivatives}\n\\dcref{ch24:24.2}\n\\group{Evolving Heat Kernels}\n\n\nIf \\(\\mathcal M\\) is closed, then \\(L\\) has a unique fundamental solution\n\\(H(x,\\tau;y,v)\\).  It is positive and smooth, hence is the heat kernel.\n\\end{theorem}\n\nFor \\(r_\\tau(x)=d_{g(\\tau)}(x,y)\\), let\n\\[\n \\widetilde E=(4\\pi(\\tau-v))^{-n/2}\n \\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{r_\\tau^2}{4(\\tau-v)}\\right),\n \\qquad\n H_N=\\widetilde E\\sum_{k=0}^N\\psi_k(\\tau-v)^k.\n\\]\nIn polar coordinates about \\(y\\), write\n\\(\\alpha_\\tau=\\sqrt{\\det g^S(\\tau)}/r_\\tau^{n-1}\\).","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Theorem</div></section>[Existence of the heat kernel on closed <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\mathcal M^n$\">$\\mathcal M^n$</span>] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-74686d3a63686f772d6969692d636c6f7365642d65766f6c76696e672d686561742d6b65726e656c\"></span> <span class=\"tex-source\" style=\"display:block\">Source: <span class=\"reference\">chow-et-al-ricci-flow-part-iii:page-0288</span></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FChowEtAl%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics%23def%3Achow-iii-evolving-heat-kernel\">↗ def:chow-iii-evolving-heat-kernel</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FChowEtAl%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics%23prop%3Achow-iii-evolving-parametrix\">↗ prop:chow-iii-evolving-parametrix</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FChowEtAl%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics%23lem%3Achow-iii-parametrix-convolution-derivatives\">↗ lem:chow-iii-parametrix-convolution-derivatives</a> <span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch24:24.2</span></span>\\group Evolving Heat Kernels <p></p>If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\mathcal M$\">$\\mathcal M$</span> is closed, then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$L$\">$L$</span> has a unique fundamental solution <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$H(x,\\tau ;y,v)$\">$H(x,\\tau ;y,v)$</span>. It is positive and smooth, hence is the heat kernel.  <p></p>For <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$r_\\tau (x)=d_{g(\\tau )}(x,y)$\">$r_\\tau (x)=d_{g(\\tau )}(x,y)$</span>, let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  \\widetilde E=(4\\pi (\\tau -v))^{-n/2} \\exp \\! \\left(-\\frac{r_\\tau ^2}{4(\\tau -v)}\\right), \\qquad H_N=\\widetilde E\\sum _{k=0}^N\\psi _k(\\tau -v)^k.  \\]\">\\[  \\widetilde E=(4\\pi (\\tau -v))^{-n/2} \\exp \\! \\left(-\\frac{r_\\tau ^2}{4(\\tau -v)}\\right), \\qquad H_N=\\widetilde E\\sum _{k=0}^N\\psi _k(\\tau -v)^k.  \\]</span> In polar coordinates about <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$y$\">$y$</span>, write <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\alpha _\\tau =\\sqrt{\\det g^S(\\tau )}/r_\\tau ^{n-1}$\">$\\alpha _\\tau =\\sqrt{\\det g^S(\\tau )}/r_\\tau ^{n-1}$</span>.","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group"]},"previous":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#def:chow-iii-evolving-heat-kernel","next":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#rem:chow-iii-changing-distance-parametrix","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#def:chow-iii-evolving-heat-kernel","title":"def:chow-iii-evolving-heat-kernel","label":"def:chow-iii-evolving-heat-kernel"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#prop:chow-iii-evolving-parametrix","title":"prop:chow-iii-evolving-parametrix","label":"prop:chow-iii-evolving-parametrix"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#lem:chow-iii-parametrix-convolution-derivatives","title":"lem:chow-iii-parametrix-convolution-derivatives","label":"lem:chow-iii-parametrix-convolution-derivatives"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#thm:chow-iii-evolving-heat-kernel-expansion","title":"thm:chow-iii-evolving-heat-kernel-expansion","label":"thm:chow-iii-evolving-heat-kernel-expansion"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/ch24-heat-kernel-evolving-metrics#lem:chow-iii-evolving-dirichlet-problem","title":"lem:chow-iii-evolving-dirichlet-problem","labe